{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56144","headline":"七真赞 三 · 杜光庭","name":"七真赞 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"济我六度行，故能解三罗。\n清斋礼太素，吐纳养云牙。\n逍遥金阙内，玉京爲余家。\n自然生七宝，人人坐莲花。\n仰嚼玄都柰，俯酣空洞瓜。\n容颜曜十日，奚计年刼多。\n法鼓会天仙，鸣钟徴大魔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}